{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[URGENT] Mantlet One needs a commander. Proxima-B is falling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a peaceful colonization and mining operation has escalated into a full-scale planetary conflict. A hostile response from the native inhabitants has turned Proxima-B into a war zone. Outposts are being wiped out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/extras/44806a4e75e0f6541b631a97e02973aa.avif?t=1755934089\" width=1565 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication lines are severed. Resistance is fierce and unrelenting. You are the Fleet Commander of Mantlet One, the last major mobile command platform in orbit. Your orders are clear, establish control on the surface, deploy infantry and mechanized units to critical locations, Crush resistance and secure assets vital to New Terra\u2019s expansion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/extras/ca134640d0786a6401693dd22463732a.avif?t=1755934089\" width=1565 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no longer a scientific expedition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is war. Start the campaign. Restore order. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For New Terra.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891310?t=1755934089","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/1727c9927bb2ac02bff484e6a07cd9ce76709ee5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755934089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/df1723dcd5a635f8f0b485c6bbd5b4b18c077e9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755934089","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/df1723dcd5a635f